大好き。でも幽霊。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自堕落な十人たちの身の回りの世話を一人でこなしているため、住人たちにとって、なくてはならない幽霊。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「おはようございます！　クラウスさん！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"131884"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/37/37c19f9ebe3b52d40af74eae50ad6f140df9d0b13bacfc5a79e337e20bb16bdc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0bc562bc2690169cff3d95866cbff1bc47d4894b327411cfdd7fabacc0f6f99b.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"橘志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s738","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s738","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s738","name":"橘 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:12654:131884:7169:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c14955","characterName":"ベランルージュ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"88237","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"12654"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18204"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14955"},"originalCharacterName":"ベランルージュ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Ainsworth mansion's living doll. She has a strong pride and doesn't trust humans. She's very fond of her pocket watch."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14955"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【アンティークドール】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"かなり昔に作られ、いつしか魂が宿ったアンティークドール。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元貴族向けの高級ドールだったからか、プライドが高く、マナーに厳しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は冷静で大人びているが、怒ると子供っぽくなることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間嫌いな面があり、よくクラウスとケンカしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「やれやれ…なのだわ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18204","sourceWorkId":"10833","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"魂を得たアンティークドール。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元が貴族向けの高級ドールだからか、プライドが高く、マナーに厳しい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は冷静で大人びているのだが、怒ると子供っぽくなることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間嫌いな面があり、クラウスとよく喧嘩をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「なによ……あっちに行きなさい。目障りなのだわ。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"88237"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9db435a92b7f4b7adf0d4201b08fbec2f71610361c27e61f8c56ab909820aba2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/2137c682ed8efd579d96efaf737981cd8e65c506084c8202409cc23a53b5f16d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"宮沢ゆあな","creatorId":"vndb:s830","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s830","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s830","name":"宮沢ゆあな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:12654:88237:5915:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c14956","characterName":"エリザベス・ガンティエール","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"88238","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"12654"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18205"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14956"},"originalCharacterName":"エリザベス・ガンティエール","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"213"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"A"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The witch living in the Ainsworth mansion. She's one of the most powerful magicians in the world, and she loves teasing the other inhabitants of the mansion and especially Klaus."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14956"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【魔女】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界に10人しかいないと言われる大魔女の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少女のような容姿だが、齢200を超えているらしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"刹那的な性格で、今この瞬間を楽しむ、そうした傾向がある。冷徹でキツイ性格で、それは態度や言動にもあらわれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"長く生きていることから豊富な知識を持ち、頭も良いが、その生活態度は非常にだらしなく、部屋は散らかりっぱなし。朝も弱い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「フッフッフ‥‥いいぞ、私はこういうのを期待していたんだ。」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18205","sourceWorkId":"10833","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界に10人しかいないと言われる大魔女の一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"態度や言動から冷徹でキツい印象を受けるが、その印象通りの中身である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人をからかったり、イジめるのが好きな真性のサド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭がいい反面、生活態度は非常にだらしない。本をそこら中に散らかしたり、床で寝たりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「眠りの邪魔をしたのは、万死に値する。死んで詫びろ。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"88238"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c75f1ba7f11c4879dc52f8af5ee44f9cfbab8c3910ad9eb9808b92e349cd12a8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0cb881045872d77adb6fe12165741ba76458ddf7e8646da97fd99b0f28aa1c03.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"雪野梨沙","creatorId":"vndb:s1610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1610","name":"雪野 梨沙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:12654:88238:5903:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c14957","characterName":"ノリーン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"131886","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"12654"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18206"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14957"},"originalCharacterName":"ノリーン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【リビングデッド】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"墓場から生き返ったゾンビ少女。"},{"spoiler":f