ホーリーナイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"気丈で男勝り、騎士道精神を重んじる少女で、言動もそれに沿っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラウスの幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「覚悟があるのなら、剣を取れ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18210","sourceWorkId":"10833","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会の洗礼を受けたホーリーナイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"騎士の名門と誉れ高い家の出で、騎士道精神を重んじ、それと同様に神への忠誠心も高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その絶対的な忠誠と正義感ゆえに、悪＝魔物への敵愾心（嫌悪）は人一倍強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「覚悟があるのなら、剣を取れ。」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148500"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b0/b0c4af7768cec47048e7e628e7b5d7581835e3959813aced857e19cf8a6c1dda.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c01b59d997f2481df7c089c500e9ce76a9394c4cbc5e65b46029948fe113532.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"平山ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s285","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s285","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s285","name":"東かりん","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:12654:148500:5905:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c14959","characterName":"リドル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148501","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"12654"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18207"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14959"},"originalCharacterName":"リドル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【ウェンディのパパ】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"紳士的でとても温厚な人物だが、比類ない実力を持った悪魔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘をこよなく愛し、平和を愛する人格者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私たちは、君を歓迎する」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18207","sourceWorkId":"10833","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"紳士的でとても温厚な人柄であるが、実際は比類なき力を持つ悪魔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな強大な力を持ちながらも無益な殺生は好まず、平和な世の中を望んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"娘のウェンディをこよなく愛し、表面上敵対している人間に対しても、分け隔てない優しさを見せる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「さすがクラウス君っ！　私が見込んだ男だけあるね！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148501"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f000ca3f369048f2207ae14d4927ac63c0f67ce8eb1ea441d918850f189f9e9c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4fdd6d9850f9c72a985307d958a376ae940eaf1846dcc445931cd8f47d04574.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c14960","characterName":"サワダスト","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148502","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"12654"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18211"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14960"},"originalCharacterName":"サワダスト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【神父】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の祖父（オズワルド）が所属していた、カトリクス教会の司教。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"金と権力への執着心が強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"オズワルド亡き後、教会の実権を握りつつある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18211","sourceWorkId":"10833","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラウスの祖父が所属していた、カトリクス教会の司教。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"金と権力への執着心が強く、今や教会の実権を握りつつある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148502"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3dbcbbf44465ab9d7cc7e8b2b32bc5c5a7e36b1090fc9edd1446d1d900ac042e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b71c8f81547193d606cba07e222d4f77326c8ff36bec687a3c08e9d57a0daf90.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c14961","characterName":"レノ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148503","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"12654"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18208"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14961"},"originalCharacterName":"レノ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【妖精猫】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ケットシー」と呼ばれる妖精猫。エロすぎる淫獣。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性陣によくいたずらしては、殴られたり蹴られたりしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし一向に懲りない、ある意味勇者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口が悪く、エロが目立つが、実は結構イイヤツだったり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「うっひょう！　モロオレ好みだゼ！！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18208","sourceWorkId":"10833","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖精猫。エロすぎる淫獣。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインたちによくセクハラをしており、殴られたり蹴られたりしているが、それにも懲りずにセクハラを続ける勇者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口が悪く、エロさが目立って悪いヤツと思われがちだが、実は結構いいヤツ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「うっひょう！　モロオレ好みだゼ!!　オマーン国債って言ってみて！　ねーねー！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"148503"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5ef1d64ef7f4ae20124d2c6e0557a4b0e75cd644daa0f24a1d3c0c9847235f91.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c62374406fb8499e5f4d6fb94c41779d2e1fde41438bd2daa6981303f33afcf4.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c14962","characterName":"パンプキン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"148504","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"12654"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18209"],"vndbCharacterId":"c14962"},"originalCharacterName":"パンプキン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate